 *   optional THIRD `::` — never `split("::")`, because model ids may contain
 *   single `:` (e.g. `glm-5.3-flash:cloud`) but never `::`. No segment may
 *   itself contain `::`; harness ids must be lowercase `[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]*`
